<title>USA: NYSE says short interest rises to 3.44 bln shrs.</title>
<headline>NYSE says short interest rises to 3.44 bln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exhange said short interest increased 157.2 million shares to 3.44 billion as of June 13, 1997.</p>
<p>Short interest as of May 15, 1997, totaled 3.28 billion shares, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
